    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"4871\" data-end=\"4885\"><em data-start=\"4871\" data-end=\"4885\">(14th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"4887\" data-end=\"4929\"><em data-start=\"4887\" data-end=\"4929\">\u201cOutcomes stand. Framing is negotiable.\u201d</em></p><p data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"5014\">Once per Soma Break, after a significant event resolves, you may choose its framing:</p><ul data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5280\"><li data-start=\"5016\" data-end=\"5076\"><p data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5076\"><strong data-start=\"5018\" data-end=\"5037\">Heroic Framing:</strong> Reduce unrest, fear, Darkness fallout.</p></li><li data-start=\"5077\" data-end=\"5142\"><p data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5142\"><strong data-start=\"5079\" data-end=\"5102\">Cautionary Framing:</strong> Increase deterrence against repetition.</p></li><li data-start=\"5143\" data-end=\"5215\"><p data-start=\"5145\" data-end=\"5215\"><strong data-start=\"5145\" data-end=\"5167\">Ambiguous Framing:</strong> Reduce exploitation and follow-up manipulation.</p></li><li data-start=\"5216\" data-end=\"5280\"><p data-start=\"5218\" data-end=\"5280\"><strong data-start=\"5218\" data-end=\"5236\">Sealed Record:</strong> Prevent political or magical weaponization.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5282\" data-end=\"5342\">You cannot change the outcome\u2014only its interpretive gravity.</p><h3 data-start=\"5344\" data-end=\"5352\">Cost</h3><p data-start=\"5353\" data-end=\"5391\">Limited use. No Surge required.</p><h3 data-start=\"5393\" data-end=\"5405\">Pushback</h3><p data-start=\"5406\" data-end=\"5522\">Altering framing too aggressively increases Noise, especially if it denies narrative consequences.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
